title: The Communist Working Group
subtitle: Levi's friends found an organisation of their own.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1921 and month >= 9 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and levi_split = 1 and levi_in_party = 0 and e21_kag_done = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 8
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_kag_done = 1;
Q.kag_exists = 1;
!}

= The Communist Working Group

Ernst Däumig, Adolph Hoffmann, Otto Brass, Curt Geyer, Paul Malzahn and a group of Reichstag deputies form the **Kommunistische Arbeitsgemeinschaft** around Levi. They say they are still communists, and against Moscow's emissaries and against putschism. They have a paper, a Reichstag group and friends in the metalworkers' union.

[? if e21_levi_fate = 4 : They are few. Levi left almost alone, after a victory, and most of his friends stayed. ?][? if e21_levi_fate != 4 : In the districts, the members who agreed with Levi are deciding whether to follow him. ?]

- @rank_and_file: Win back the rank and file, one by one.
- @renegades: Denounce them as renegades.
- @talks: Offer the KAG joint work in the unions.

@rank_and_file
subtitle: Patient. Most of the waverers stay.
on-arrival: {!
var f = (Q.e21_levi_fate == 4) ? 0.99 : 0.95;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= f;
}
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

Party organisers visit every member who has stopped paying dues. Most of them are not interested in Levi. They are tired, or out of work, and many come back.

@renegades
view-if: offensive_gone = 0
subtitle: A clean line, and every doubter shown the door. The Left will be pleased.
on-arrival: {!
var f = (Q.e21_levi_fate == 4) ? 0.97 : 0.89;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= f;
}
Q.unity += 4;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
!}

The Rote Fahne calls the KAG a bridge back to the SPD for deserters, and invites every member with doubts to cross it. Thousands do.

@talks
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Comrades in another room. Moscow will ask why we are talking to a man the International expelled.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any deal with Levi's group.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
var f = (Q.e21_levi_fate == 4) ? 0.99 : 0.96;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= f;
}
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', -6);
!}

The Zentrale proposes joint work in the unions and the Reichstag. Levi accepts, coolly.
